  "bodyHash": "19ce56756c7e1102",
  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UniversalBestiary/BH_UB_Header.png\" alt=\"UB Header\" width=\"1261\" height=\"328\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/757754103207166046\" alt=\"Discord\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/github/last-commit/Lykrast/UniversalBestiary\" alt=\"Lines of Code\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/tokei/lines/github/lykrast/universalbestiary\" alt=\"Lines of code\"></p>\n<p>你是否曾遇到过不认识的动物，想知道如何繁殖它们，以及是否值得？你是否曾与怪物战斗过，却并不清楚它们究竟在做什么？你是否曾希望有一个清晰的清单，用来检查你是否已经遭遇了世界中所有的生物？</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>如果你回答是，那么《万能 bestiary（生物图鉴）》正是你需要的模组。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>通过将书和皮革结合，你可以制作一本专属的小书，其中将包含在你世界中可能遇到的所有生物的页面。有三种方式可以解锁特定生物的页面：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>击杀它</li>\n<li>被它杀死</li>\n<li>制作一个生物识别器并在近距离对该生物使用</li>\n</ul>\n<p>即使你从未触碰过这本书或没有携带它，你也可以解锁页面。如果你弄丢了它，总是可以再获取一本新的，并且之前解锁的所有条目都会保留。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UniversalBestiary/BH_UB_Supported.png\" alt=\"UB Supported Mods\" width=\"1261\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>《万能 bestiary》支持生存模式下可见的全部 46 种原版生物，以及许多其他模组添加的生物，未来还将计划添加更多。目前支持的模组包括：</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/aqua-creepers\" rel=\"nofollow\">Aqua Creepers!</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/biomes-o-plenty\" rel=\"nofollow\">Biomes O' Plenty</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/botania\" rel=\"nofollow\">Botania</a> - 2</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/charm\" rel=\"nofollow\">Charm</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/roboticparts\" rel=\"nofollow\">Cyberware</a> <em>（又名 Robotics Parts）</em> - 2</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/embers-rekindled\" rel=\"nofollow\">Embers Rekindled</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/energeticsheep\" rel=\"nofollow\">EnergeticSheep</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/grimoire-of-gaia\" rel=\"nofollow\">Grimoire of Gaia</a> - 71</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/harvesters-night\" rel=\"nofollow\">Harvester's Night</a>&nbsp;- 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/ice-and-fire-dragons\" rel=\"nofollow\">Ice and Fire: Dragons in a whole new light!</a>&nbsp;- 18</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/industrial-foregoing\" rel=\"nofollow\">Industrial Foregoing</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/sbm-merpig\" rel=\"nofollow\">Merpig</a>&nbsp;- 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/mystical-wildlife\" rel=\"nofollow\">Mystical Wildlife</a> - 10</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/natura\" rel=\"nofollow\">Natura</a> - 4 <em>（具体数量可能因配置而异）</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/openblocks\" rel=\"nofollow\">OpenBlocks</a>&nbsp;- 2</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/quark\" rel=\"nofollow\">Quark</a> - 4 <em>（具体数量可能因配置而异）</em></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/the-midnight\" rel=\"nofollow\">The Midnight</a> - 8</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/thermal-foundation\" rel=\"nofollow\">Thermal Foundation</a> - 3</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://minecraft.curseforge.com/projects/tinkers-construct\" rel=\"nofollow\">Tinkers' Construct</a> - 1</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/totemic\" rel=\"nofollow\">Totemic</a> - 3</li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/wizardry-mod\" rel=\"nofollow\">Wizardry</a> - 3</li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UniversalBestiary/BH_UB_Spotlight.png\" alt=\"UB Mod Spotlight\" width=\"1261\" height=\"189\"></p>\n<p>模组特写视频由 Trikzon 制作（其中的支持模组列表已过时）：</p>\n<p><span><iframe allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/aU99cO4xzpA?wmode=transparent\" height=\"358\" width=\"638\"></iframe></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你可以自由地在<a href=\"https://github.com/Lykrast/UniversalBestiary/issues\" rel=\"nofollow\">问题追踪器</a>中提交新模组的建议，只需附上该模组的链接即可。不过请注意，我已经有一个庞大的待办事项列表需要处理：<a href=\"https://github.com/Lykrast/UniversalBestiary/issues/1\" rel=\"nofollow\">big todo list</a>。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/UniversalBestiary/BH_UB_PromoCard.png\" alt=\"UB BH Code\" width=\"1261\" height=\"265\">&nbsp;</p>",
